<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n110848" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φίλ-ανδρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>loving men;</i> of a
			country, <i>loving its men,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Th.</u>
					902
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>loving masculine habits,</i> of Atalanta, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				1111
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἀμαζόνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Thes.</u>
					26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of women,
				<i>lewd,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				191e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>loving one's husband,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ep.Tit.
				2.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.431
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Alc.</u>
				8
			</span></i>, Iamb.post Polem.<i><span class="en">
				p.48
			</span></i> Hinck, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Halc.</u>
				8
			</span></i>; freq. in epitaphs, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epigr.Gr.</u>
				387.12
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Apamea</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.1976
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχῇ φιλανδροτάτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			. 
			<i><span class="en">
				607f
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Caralis</span>). Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ρως, ἔζησε</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				12(3).280
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Anaphe</span>).</div>
